    "number": 56,
    "title": "Adopt shared guide planning and delivery checkpoints",
    "body": "## Change\n\nAdopt the shared guide checkpoints for [Hub #83](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/issues/83). The repository continues to use its ordinary SDLC; `plan-work` and `deliver-work` run only when explicitly invoked. Replace the obsolete delivery-skill reference and report guide synchronization, public publication and live verification separately.\n\nThe shared checkpoint baseline is agent-skills `ff80d247ea96a5d4c461d30a2c24148376197c7b`. No product behavior, OpenSpec delta, installation or physical-device change is involved. No skills were installed or copied.\n\n## Validation and completion\n\nNode 24, `npm ci`, `npm run check:workflow`, `npm run test:workflow` and `git diff --check` pass. Independent Standards/Specification reviews and all five current-head CI jobs remain required before guarded merge; all five main jobs must pass afterward.\n\n- Source/tracker: this companion implements the Pixoo instruction portion of Hub #83; it does not close the owning issue.\n- Guide source: [Hub #88](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/pull/88), currently pending; it records refreshed inputs and the specific architecture no-impact reason.\n- Public publication/live verification: pending separately authorized publication and all nine route/hash checks.\n- Owner/next action: the Hub #83 coordinator links the companion and records exact source and guide revisions after verified merges.\n\nGitHub currently refuses to start required CI because of an account payment/spending-limit restriction. The account owner must restore Actions availability, after which the coordinator will rerun the unchanged candidates. No CI, browser, merge or publication gate is waived.\n\nIndependent Standards and Specification reviews report no remaining P0–P3 findings at the final source comparisons: Hub `ddcc91543119eb60ed313cf5300b57de537ad64c`, Pixoo `76e681a36c5426d4ede538e7d83494e2d52da538`, Nanoleaf `2cb2d6d614d94b9207cf71f366c4033e6fcfd954`. The Pixoo provisioning pin defect was corrected and independently re-reviewed. Review requested Astra/high; instruction rehearsals requested Sol/high; executing identity/reasoning and coordinator reasoning are not independently exposed. No review waives CI, browser, human approval or publication acceptance.\n\n[Delivery evidence and recovery steps](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/issues/83#issuecomment-5611056705) record the final revisions, both independent reviews, 21 simulated instruction decisions, CI blockers and remaining source/guide/public/live stages.\n",
    "state": "open",
